"7. In the result, I pass the following order:
Dr Premalatha Shetty vs Special Land Acquisition Officer on 9 June, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/184383369/
9 ORDER i) Writ petition is disposed off;
ii) The dispute involved in the present petition with regard to quantum of compensation payable to the petitioners as well as the legality, validity and correctness of the - 13 - NC: 2023:KHC:20442 impugned awards are hereby referred to the Deputy Commissioner/
Statutory Arbitrator before whom, the petitions filed by the respondents challenging the first /
original awards passed by the respondents which were subject matter of Valerial Sequeria's case (supra) are pending adjudication for disposal in accordance with law.
iii) The Deputy Commissioner/ Statutory Arbitrator before whom the aforesaid petitions filed by the respondents are pending, is hereby directed to club / tag the dispute involved in the present writ petition also along with pending petitions and dispose of the same together in accordance with law;
iv) Liberty is reserved in favour of the petitioners herein to file pleadings, documents, etc. in the matters referred to the Deputy Commissioner/ Statutory Arbitrator pursuant to this order;
v) All rival contentions are kept open and no opinion is expressed on the same;
vi) The Deputy Commissioner/ Statutory Arbitrator is directed to dispose of all the - 14 - NC: 2023:KHC:20442 proceedings including the proceedings referred to under this order, within a period of six months from the date of receipt of a copy of this order;
vii) It is made clear that this order is restricted to the petitioners only and is made in the peculiar/
special facts and circumstances of the instant case and shall not be treated as a precedent nor having any precedential value for any purpose whatsoever."
